skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
hide footbox

actor "Economic operator" as User
participant "Economic-operator IAM" as IAM #FFF2CC
participant "Economic-operator\nDPP service" as DPP #FFF2CC
participant "Economic-operator\nAAS service" as AAS #D9EAF7

User -> DPP : Create, read, or update DPP data
DPP -> IAM : Authenticate economic operator
IAM --> DPP : AAS token for self-hosted operator role
DPP -> AAS : Create, read, or update AAS data\nwith trusted token
AAS -> AAS : Example 8: check operator role;\nauthorize CREATE, READ, or UPDATE
AAS --> DPP : Requested or changed AAS data
DPP --> User : DPP result
@enduml
